{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Afterblast is an exhilarating, high-octane multiplayer first-person shooter that takes action to new heights with its dynamic parkour mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players navigate through crumbling urban landscapes, leaping across rooftops and engaging in combat with a diverse arsenal of weapons and gadgets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every match is a fast-paced adrenaline rush where strategy and agility are key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're dodging enemy fire or performing parkour maneuvers, Afterblast delivers a  experience that keeps you on the edge of your seat. Join the fight, master your parkour skills, and dominate the battlefield with the ultimate test of reflexes and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the newly added gamemodes, Capture the Flag and Deathmatch, as well as team-based modes. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3149180?t=1743219617","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3149180?t=1743219617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149180/e88bf3423a900a90b70ca58a505581d7ff32d5f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743219617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149180/e88bf3423a900a90b70ca58a505581d7ff32d5f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743219617","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Afterblast is an exhilarating, high-octane multiplayer first-person shooter that takes action to new heights with its dynamic parkour mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players navigate through crumbling urban landscapes, leaping across rooftops and engaging in combat with a diverse arsenal of weapons and gadgets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every match is a fast-paced adrenaline rush where strategy and agility are key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're dodging enemy fire or performing parkour maneuvers, Afterblast delivers a  experience that keeps you on the edge of your seat. Join the fight, master your parkour skills, and dominate the battlefield with the ultimate test of reflexes and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the newly added gamemodes, Capture the Flag and Deathmatch, as well as team-based modes. </p>","developers":["Sully Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149180/eec1ec961553c0eed693a3692393244c7d4fec6c/header.jpg?t=1743219617","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257052737,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257052737/movie480.mp4?t=1742783191","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257052737/movie_max.mp4?t=1742783191"},"name":"Trailer Beta","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257052737/713618ad132eea7b315029fe32b54023c5358b0c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742783191","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257052737/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742783191","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257052737/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742783191"}}],"name":"Afterblast","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 or Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><stron